<title>USA: American Healthcorp Q4 shr $0.13 inc gain.</title>
<headline>American Healthcorp Q4 shr $0.13 inc gain.</headline>
<text>
<p>NASHVILLE, Tenn., Oct 4 (Reuter)</p>
<p>			   8/31/96		   8/31/95</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.13		    $0.11</p>
<p> Net			  1,102			894</p>
<p> Revs			16,340		   14,591</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,226		    8,066</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.40		    $0.48</p>
<p> Net			  3,260		    3,916</p>
<p> Revs			60,609		   56,609</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   8,161		    8,211</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>The full company name is American Healthcorp Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the fourth fiscal 1996 quarter included a $0.09 per share gain related to the favorable resolution of income tax issues with the Internal Revenue Service.</p>
